siness_id":"5Y2lmM-e6foq2fhM4oRvtg","review_id":"R4c5-nC-HZ2wWAXB1fg3kw","date":"2019-03-08T14:31:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9290085434913635,"text_excerpt":"This place was pretty good , our usual place was closed Monday so we tried to find a replacement and they had all pretty much all the things we were craving , some of the stuff was kinda dry bc I think it was from older batches but when I went to get seconds they had replaced it and it was better , the service was good the staff was very friendly . And it seemed that they had a lot of regulars coming it so that's a good sign . The sushi was really good for a buffet lol but the Mongolian grill didn't seem to be up and running I really liked the crab Rangoons as well I would deff try this place out and I will go again"},{"business_id":"5Y2lmM-e6foq2fhM4oRvtg","review_id":"8u3PfHjr0NCsv9TEV5quMQ","date":"2017-05-21T01:37:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9107141494750977,"text_excerpt":"It's a Chinese buffet. I see folks on here crying about it not being \"authentic\". It's a buffet. They have buffet staples. The sushi is kinda meh, but it's cool and edible. There's a nice selection of hot food and soups. It's much better than any nearby Chinese buffets. It's easy, fast, and reasonably priced. Also- hooray for soft serve ice cream."},{"business_id":"5Y2lmM-e6foq2fhM4oRvtg","review_id":"J0B_UxZ88eZhFMN4TRBo8A","date":"2018-09-05T15:15:55","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9082973003387451,"text_excerpt":"For the price, this place is good.. For the quality, very good.. Get here for lunch, if you wait it gets a little bit over warmed. But around noon, and the food is fresh hot and not to be missed.. I love this place for lunch.. But be warned, you'll want to crawl under your desk at work and take a good, long nap."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5Y2lmM-e6foq2fhM4oRvtg","photo_id":"OIJFm03sH_322AyfMpPZ0g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/OIJFm03sH_322AyfMpPZ0g.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
